{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/704","id":4737217527,"node_id":"PR_kwDORnQJEs8AAAABGlwz9w","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/704","diff_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/704.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/704.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/704","number":704,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"refactor(dunning-v2): D2b - v1 dispute marker, env validation and fixtures split from #688 (byte-identical move)","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Tier:** T4 (money path). **Current head:** `49d0b66e` after RESTACK (B-DUNMR-120, merge-only onto #688 `21714f7b`); 694 lines.\n**Why:** dunning v2 legacy-hook changes (v1 `dunning.service.ts` dispute marker, env validation) gate access and Stripe collection.\n**T4 trigger scan:** money path (dunning, Stripe invoice state), access gating (entitlement), webhook ordering. Hit.\n**T3 trigger scan:** env validation (`FEATURE_DUNNING_V2` parsing). Hit; covered by T4.\n**Bounded T1:** none; every line here was audited at #688 `2368d5fa`.\n**Canonical builder:** B-DUNSPLIT-119 (agent 119).\n**Parent owner:** operator agent 119; stack dunning v2 (#687 D1 -> #688 D2a -> this D2b -> D2c -> D3 #689 -> D4 #690 -> D5 #691).\n**Acceptance evidence:** CI-lane replay at `d92c83df` (tree equal to #688 `2368d5fa` + main merge + the D1 copy fix): 147 of 150 passed; the 3 fails were a D1 test regex since fixed in D1 `13c008a6` (see the FIX ROUND comment for the run at this head). Probes replayed: Opus 116 lost-dispute, Sol 116 d2, Sol 118 688-probe and 688-probe-v2, Opus 118 688 parts 1-4, plus the D1 probes.\n**Promotion triggers:** none while FEATURE_DUNNING_V2 is off. The flag must stay off until D2c is merged: before D2c, the dispute copy (\"access has ended, billing is paused\") would go out on the old compressed cycle without a pause.\n\n## What this piece is\nSplit of #688 under the 12:33 size rule (new pieces at or under 1,500 changed lines). The diff is a byte-identical move from #688 `2368d5fa`:\n- `src/checkout/dunning.service.ts` (v1 hooks: dispute marker, flag-gated)\n- `src/common/env-validation.ts`\n- `test/dunning-v2-service-fixes.spec.ts`\n- `test/fixtures/stripe/dunning-v2/*.json` (7 files, moved up from #687 to make room there; only D5 specs read them)\n\n## Seams and line counts\n| Piece | PR | Base | Changed lines |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| D1 | #687 | main | 2,822 (grandfathered, under 3,000) |\n| D2a | #688 | #687 | 2,440 (grandfathered) — `dunning-v2.service.ts` + `test/dunning-v2-service.spec.ts` (+1 privacy-list line) |\n| D2b | this | #688 | 694 (615+/79-) |\n| D2c | #705 | #704 | 1,287 |\n\nSeam rule: file-level only. An intra-file seam would leave unaudited intermediate code; every line here equals the audited `2368d5fa`. Each piece compiles and passes its own specs with the flag off.\n\n#689 (D3) is based on #688's branch, so its displayed diff now includes D2b and D2c until it is retargeted (B-DUNB-119 owns #689-#691; not touched here).\n\n## Fix rounds\n| Round | Job | Head | Closed | Comment |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| OPENING | B-DUNSPLIT-119 (agent 119) | `276a9f60` | split from #688 (no behaviour change) | [OPENING](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/704#issuecomment-5984075128) |\n| RESTACK | B-DUNMR-120 (agent 120) | `49d0b66e` | none: merge of D2a `21714f7b` (and main via `32d886bb`, B-DUNR-119); D2b diff unchanged | [RESTACK](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/704#issuecomment-5999324570) |\n\n","created_at":"2026-10-04T20:04:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T17:10:46Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2eb21345985a228cac2ef222df00d3a0b28c107d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11278565662,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEFBHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/labels/size/size/XL","name":"size/size/XL","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/704/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/704/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/704/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/statuses/49d0b66e8a0a1cab02f0a5a03d48cad276a08e20","head":{"label":"B